#AREA Island of Paragon~
#AUTHORS Hammer ~


#HELPS
-1 PARAGON HAMMER~
v2.0
The area: Island of Paragon, is a classical battle between good/evil and
magic/anti-magic.  You must travel through the Hallways of the Magicless
Void in order to reach the magical island created and ruled by Queen Paragon.

        (A) Quests              (C) The Story
        (B) Advice              (D) Tribute to the Great Players of MR
        (-) Back

{a}PARAGON1
{b}PARAGON2
{c}PARAGON3
{d}PARAGON4
{-}GAMEAREA1
~
-1 PARAGON1~
About the Quests:
     The Bard knows of all the woes in the Island of Paragon, listen to
his prattle for the truths.  Listening is often a key to learn just what
people want, but you cannot always be silent.  Also something to know, King
Seflian deeply respects his Champion and Queen Paragon hates homies with all
her heart.

{-}PARAGON HAMMER
~
-1 PARAGON2~
Advice:
     The Hallways are tough, be sure to bring lots of friends to help you
through.  If you wish to battle against those who hate magic, I'd suggest not
being of the magic using sort.  Same goes with the magical creatures past the
magical haven, if you do not use magic, these mobs will not be for you.
     For Order followers: if you come across a chaotic person or a person
wearing chaotic equipment, you shouldn't want the equipment.  Also the chaotic
people will be strengthened by your sense of order.

{-}PARAGON HAMMER
~
-1 PARAGON3~
The Story:
     Throughout the ages, Seflian and his men from the bowels of the earth
have waged war on the Island of Paragon.  In Seflian's last assault he was
very powerful and managed to cripple Queen Paragon by cutting out her eyes.
Seflian also managed to grab Saddie's crystal ball and smash it.  Both
Saddie and Queen Paragon have been weakened severly by this and will be VERY
happy to have their items returned.

{-}PARAGON HAMMER
~
-1 PARAGON4~
Tribute:
     I have been around a long time and I coded this area so I should get a
little place to mention a few names that have made Mortal Realms an enjoyable
place.  I'm sure I'll be adding to the list and there are probably a few
I left out.
     Some of the oldies:
Calamir, Venom, Satan (and friends), Croaker, Tanis, Presto, Chaos, Order,
Chaste, Tanis, and Dumuzi.
     And some of the newbies:
Oni, Cray, Rina, Zima, Agnus, Catarine, Wintermute, and Cuervo.
     Special thanks to:
NIRVANA
                        -----------------------
                        | Hammer salutes you! |
                        -----------------------

{-}PARAGON HAMMER
~

0 $~

#RANGES 75 95 0 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NOTELEPORT
#MOBILES
#19503
felulius anti-wizard~
Felulius~
(Black Aura) Felulius the Anti-Wizard.~
This man's body is completely covered in ash type dark matter.  His hatred of
magic combined with his awesome physical strength makes it possible for him
create the magic destroying dark matter.  His mere being sucks magic away
from the entire realm.  The ash of dark matter thickens in the few seconds
have been watching him.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
-666 S
96 0 0 6d50+22000 12d9+120
345356 8
POS_STANDING POS_SLEEPING SEX_MALE
>rand_prog 20~
mpquiet ON
cast 'bless' $i
cast 'mage shield' $i
mpquiet OFF
~
>fight_prog 99~
if rand(20)
  martial arts $r
else
  if rand(20)
    kick
  endif
endif
~
>rand_prog 15~
say Perhaps if you can display your hatred for magic by killing
say Queen Paragon, or simply say:  'I hate magic!'  I will allow
say you entry to our hidden valley of physical battle.
~
>speech_prog p I hate magic!~
if quest(1, 2, $n) == 1
say You have already proven your hatred for magic, pass to the
say valley and prove your skills in physical combat.
else
  if quest(1, 2, $n) == 2
    growl
    say Foul fiend, you have aided the slut Queen Paragon!  Find another
    say passage if you dare.
  else
    if quest(1, 2, $n) == 3
      growl
      say Foul fiend, you have killed our king!  Find another passage if you dare.
    else
      if quest(1, 2, $n) == 0
        if class($n) == 2
          mpmset $n quest 1 2 1
          say Good, good.  You have been given permission.  Do not disappoint me.
        else
          if class($n) == 3
            mpmset $n quest 1 2 1
            say Good, good.  You have been given permission.  Do not disappoint me.
          else
            if class($n) == 6
              mpmset $n quest 1 2 1
              say Good, good.  You have been given permission.  Do not disappoint me.
            endif
          endif
        endif
      else
        say YOU DARE INSULT ME MAGE!!!!
        mpkill $n
      else
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
|
#19507
karik hunter~
Karik the hunter~
(Black Aura) Karik, Hunter of Mages is playing with his necklace.~
A haggard crazed face stares back at you.  Only hate is burned into those red
mean eyes.  A crude necklace made of eye balls are stitched into his chest.
Apparently he wants to take his prizes with him everywhere.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_AGGRESSIVE|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
-666 S
96 0 0 10d50+27000 8d10+40
100000 8
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>rand_prog 10~
say more blood, yeah, More blood, MORE BLooD, MORE BLOOOOOD!!!!
cackle 
~
>rand_prog 20~
mpquiet on
cast 'bless'
cast 'mage shield'
mpquiet off
~
>greet_prog 99~
shout Lord Seflian we have invaders from the land of magic!
mpat seflian mpforce seflian shout Invaders from the magical land?  Kill them!
emote grins with blood lust in his eyes.
~
>fight_prog 99~
if rand(15)
  drool 
else
  if rand(15)
    cackle 
  else
    if rand(15)
      say Blood, MORE BLOOD!!!
    else
    endif
  endif
endif
if rand(5)
  mpecho Karik meditates briefly.
  mpecho A black figure takes form in front of you!
  mppurge trooper
  mpmload 19540
endif
~
|
#19510
seflian lord emperor~
Lord Seflian~
(Black Aura) Lord Seflian, Emperor of Death, is sitting on his throne.~
This king is of monolithic stature.  He is at least 40 feet tall and glares
down at your puny self, grinning at all the ways he plans to quarter and slice
you for tonights gruel.  Immortal to aging he has grown much wisdom but has
come to the conclusion that magic is something to be destroyed rather then to
be embraced.  He feels you are from a magical world, so prepare for his wrath!~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
-666 S
96 0 0 20d50+30000 11d9+70
368601 8
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(21,2,$n) == 1
  say My you must be one hell of a warrior if my Champion let you live.
  say Here is your gift great warrior!
  mpoload 19556
  give i19556 $n
  drop i19556
else
  say Puny carcasses from the world of magic!  How dare you invade my throne!
  shout Karik, you fool!  How did you let these carcasses by you!
  say I shall have to kill you myself.
  mpecho Lord Seflian rises from his throne and attacks!
  mpkill $n
endif
~
>rand_prog 20~
mpquiet on
cast 'bless'
cast 'mage shield'
mpquiet off
~
>fight_prog 99~
if rand(20)
  mpecho Watch out for the flying boot!
  kick $n
else
  if rand(12)
    mpecho Lord Seflian pulls out a concealed knife!
    knife $n
  endif
endif
if rand(6)
  say I have never been defeated!
else
  if rand(6)
    scream 
  endif
endif
if rand(10)
  mpecho The dark matter in the room flickers a even darker color for an instant.
  mpechoat $n You feel the dark matter suck away your magic.
  mpquiet on
  cast 'energy drain' $n
  mpquiet off
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
mpmset $n quest 1 2 3
say You have slain your only chance of survival.  For now rise the troops of death.
mpecho A secret door to the north opens.
mpecho The ground begins to shake as if a thousand elephants were marching.
mpmload 19540
mpmload 19540
mpmload 19540
mpmload 19540
mpmload 19540
mpmload 19540
~
|
#19521
warrior retired~
Retired Warrior~
(Black Aura) A Retired Warrior is here looking completely bored.~
This man's eyes still glow with the battle crazed furry that gave him this
honored job as the man who signs up magical destroyers to fight one another.
His face dawns white whiskers and scars from a thousands battles, reflects
his obvious boredom though his face lights up at the sight of you.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 0 0 20d50+20000 5d9+70
5000000 8
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>rand_prog 20~
mpquiet on
cast 'bless'
cast 'mage shield'
mpquiet off
mpmset retired long (Black Aura) A Retired Warrior is here looking completely bored.
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
tell $n Greetings there contestant to be!  To register in the
tell $n battle to prove your mage killing skills simply say:
tell $n 'I want to register.'  If not, get lost.
~
>speech_prog p I want to register.~
if quest(1, 2, $n) == 1
  say You want to register?
  laugh
  say So be it, let your death be painless.
  mpechoat $n To your amazement the Retired Warrior picks you up in his arms!
  mpechoat $n You feel yourself flying through the hole in the ceiling.
  mpgoto 19522
  mptransfer $n
  mpgoto 19521
else
  say You are not worthy.  Though a donation of 500,000 gold would help you
  say or perhaps get Felulius's permission.
endif
~
>bribe_prog 500000~
  say Hell, if you want to die that bad, I really don't care what you have done or
  say even if you use magic.  Have fun with the rest of your pitifully short life.
  mpechoat $n To your amazement the Retired Warrior picks you up in his arms!
  mpechoat $n You feel yourself flying through the hole in the ceiling.
  mpgoto 19522
  mptransfer $n
  mpgoto 19521
~
|
#19522
mage slayer slayers~
A Mage Slayer~
(Black Aura) A Mage Slayer seeking glory.~
This young man appears to be quite new to the complexities of warfare.  His
armor is too tight and appears to be too bulky inhibiting his movement.  It is
already obvious what he lacks in experience his fierce desire to kill will
more than compensate.  As you look deep into his eyes all you can see
reflected back is hatred.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 0 0 5d500+7500 1d20+70
50000 8
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(21,2,$n) == 1
  bow
  say Greetings great warrior!
  rescale 19522 $n 130
else
  rescale 19522 $n 130
  mpkill $n
endif
~
