An Animated Helper of Saddie's~
An Animated Helper of Saddie's, looking for something here.~
A ragtag compilation of body parts which are barely humanoid.  Muscles, tissue,
and bones are poking out from the living corpse.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_CLEAR|AFF_HUNT|AFF_TONGUES
-1000 S
75 BODY_ARM BODY_ARM 5d15+3600 4d5+50
1000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>death_prog 99~
mpjunk all
say You will not get the shard.
~
>entry_prog 85~
say The shards of glass making the crystal ball, I must have them.  Saddie will
say reward me!
~
>rand_prog 30~
disguise (Charmed) (White Aura) An Animated Helper of Saddie's, looking for something.
~
>rand_prog 8~
say It is said that when all the shards are brought together they will join
say to recreate the crystal ball.
~
>rand_prog 7~
say I over heard Saddie say once there was a secret place that if you activated
say the crystal ball in you could get to her palace.
~
>speech_prog help~
say You want to help?  Oh goodie, be sure and give me the credit!
mpoload 19612
mpoload 19603
give shard $n
say oh!  And here is a key to use after you have the crystal ball working.
give key $n
mpjunk i19612
mpjunk i19603
~
