#19640
saddie~
Saddie~
Saddie the Necromancer, experimenting with some dead flesh.~
A splendid young lady with fantastic proportions.  Long legs, slender hips,
large breasts...  Something appears a little bit plastic about it though,
perhaps you see something in the way she moves, but this body seems something
of a shell for something hideous underneath.  Her eyes are the biggest clue
a glowing red with only slits for pupils like that of a serpent's.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
-1000 S
100 BODY_ARM BODY_ARM 1d1+28000 8d9+80
368981 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>greet_prog 99~
say Welcome to my little palace, make yourself comfortable.
say Oh, I'll go ahead and write some scrolls up for you if
say you give me a scroll and 1,000,000 gold.
~
>fight_prog 45~
mpecho Saddie's eyes turn dark red.
cast 'energy drain' $n
~
>death_prog 99~
say NOOOOOOOOOO!!! I CAN'T DIE!  I sold my soul for this eternal life!!!
scream 
~
>give_prog i19628~
say Well, I don't really need the scroll.  Just give me the 1 MIL in gold.
~
>bribe_prog 1000000~
mpecho Saddie creates a scroll before your eyes!
if rand(11)
  mpjunk i19618
  mpoload 19618
  give scroll $n
  drop i19618
else
  if rand(11)
    mpjunk i19619
    mpoload 19619
    give scroll $n
    drop i19619
  else
    if rand(11)
      mpjunk i19620
      mpoload 19620
      give scroll $n
      drop i19620
    else
      if rand(11)
        mpjunk i19621
        mpoload 19621
        give scroll $n
        drop i19621
      else
        if rand(11)
          mpjunk i19622
          mpoload 19622
          give scroll $n
          drop i19622
        else
          if rand(11)
            mpjunk i19623
            mpoload 19623
            give scroll $n
            drop i19623
          else
            if rand(11)
              mpjunk i19624
              mpoload 19624
              give scroll $n
              drop i19624
            else
              if rand(11)
                mpjunk i19625
                mpoload 19625
                give scroll $n
                drop i19625
              else
                if rand(11)
                  mpjunk i19626
                  mpoload 19626
                  give scroll $n
                  drop i19626
                else
                  if rand(11)
                    mpjunk i19627
                    mpoload 19627
                    give scroll $n
                    drop i19626
                  else
                    say Thanks for the money, I'll be keeping the scroll.
                    cackle
                  endif
                endif
              endif
            endif
          endif
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
