#19650
small fairy~
A Small Fairy~
A Small Fairy burning brightly here.~
A happy little Fairy is darting back and forth tending her magical garden.
She looks like she is in complete bliss with a huge smile spread accross her
glowing face.	Shhhhh, don't disturb her.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_FAERIE_FIRE
0 S
95 0 0 5d500+7500 1d20+70
50000 0
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if class($n) == 2
  rescale 19650 $n 100
  mpechoat $n A Small Faerie chirps 'BAAAD! BAAAD! Warrior!'
  mpkill $n
else
  if class($n) == 3
    rescale 19650 $n 100
    mpechoat $n A Small Fairy chirps 'BAAAD! BAAAD! Warrior!'
    mpkill $n
  else
    if class($n) == 6
      rescale 19650 $n 100
      mpechoat $n A Small Fairy chirps 'BAAAD! BAAAD! Warrior!'
      mpkill $n
    else
      mpechoat $n A Small Fairy chirps 'Hello magic user!'
      rescale 19650 $n 135
    endif
  endif
endif
~
