#19662
large fairy~
A Large Fairy~
A Large Fairy is sprucing up the forest here.~
This enourmous and awkward looking Fairy is hastily waving his wand back and
forth creating magical havoc all around.  The already animated flowers and
trees are now splitting into two halves both parts completely alive thanks to
this nutty fairy.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_FAERIE_FIRE
0 S
95 0 0 4d50+8000 1d4+72
75000 0
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if class($n) == 2
  rescale 19662 $n 110
  mpechoat $n A Large Fairy chirps 'BAAAD! BAAAD! Warrior!'
  mpkill $n
else
  if class($n) == 3
    rescale 19662 $n 110
    mpechoat $n A Large Fairy chirps 'BAAAD! BAAAD! Warrior!'
    mpkill $n
  else
    if class($n) == 6
      rescale 19662 $n 110
      mpechoat $n A Large Fairy chirps 'BAAAD! BAAAD! Warrior!'
      mpkill $n
    else
      mpechoat $n A Large Fairy chirps 'Hello magic user!'
      rescale 19662 $n 150
    endif
  endif
endif
~
|
