#19666
young dandy~
A Young Dandy~
A Young Dandy is standing here clearly scared half to death.~
This shivering wimp who messed himself is standing here trying to look tough.
For some reason or other he sought to prove himself in the poor quarter.  But
when he got out here and saw the true horror and death the realization of his
mistake dawned on him, unfortunately for him it is too late.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 0 0 4d50+8000 1d20+70
100000 8
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(3,3,$n) == 1
  scream
  rescale 19666 $n 140
  say OH MY GOD IT IS A SCOOUNDRAL!!!!!!
  mpecho A Young dandy explodes in terror!
  mppurge $i
else
  say Cccaann, You get my MOMMY!!!
  rescale 19666 $n 140
endif
~
|
