#19670
ruffian~
A Ruffian~
A Ruffian is standing here looking for a mark.~
This guy is the product of living in the hood for the last twenty years.
Scars rivet his body next to his tattoo's.  He sneers at you as if killing you
is not only the next thing on his mind, it seems as if he is actually looking
forward to it.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 0 0 5d50+8000 1d20+65
100000 8
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(3,3,$n) == 1
  bow
  say Greetings Scoundral!
  rescale 19670 $n 190
else
  say Time to die fool!
  rescale 19670 $n 190
  mpkill $n
endif
~
>rand_prog 5~
say Only one way to be a scoundral, that is to waste a bunch of ruffian.
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(1,4,$n) == 0
  mpmset $n quest 1 4 1
else
  if quest(1,4,$n) == 1
    mpmset $n quest 1 4 2
  else
    if quest(1,4,$n) == 2
      mpmset $n quest 1 4 3
    else
      if quest(1,4,$n) == 3
        mpmset $n quest 1 4 4
      else
        if quest(1,4,$n) == 4
          mpmset $n quest 1 4 5
        else
          if quest(1,4,$n) == 5
            mpmset $n quest 1 4 6
          else
            if quest(1,4,$n) == 6
              mpmset $n quest 1 4 7
            else
              if quest(1,4,$n) == 7
                mpmset $n quest 1 4 8
              else
                if quest(1,4,$n) == 8
                  mpmset $n quest 1 4 9
                else
                if quest(1,4,$n) == 9
                  mpmset $n quest 3 3 1
                  mpecho A Ruffian coughs up some blood trying to speak.
                  say Your're a scoundral aren't you?
                endif
              endif
            endif
          endif 
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
|
