#ROOMS
#19500
Entrance to the Magicless Void~
Long black walls stretch forth all around you creating a long narrow hallway.
Something feels different in these rooms, as if a part of you is being sucked
away and into the dark matter the walls are comprised of.  The halls lead to
the north with further blackness and salvation can be found to the south.
There is a sign here.~
195 ROOM_DARK|ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
The Hallways of the Magicless Void.~
~
0 -1 19501
DDIR_SOUTH
The Edge of a Cliff.~
~
0 -1 19552
E
sign~
The sign says:

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|                                                                            |
|                    The Hallways of the Magicless Void                      |
|                             Created by Hammer                              |
|                                                                            |
|          Be Careful for out in the ignorance of magical deprivation        |
|     lay many monsters seeking to destroy those they cannot understand.     |
|                                                                            |
------------------------------------------------------------------------------~
S
#19501
Along the Hallways~
Dark walls which seem to suck out light, create a long narrow hallway. The
part of your mind that once had the ability to create magic seems drained.
The walls around you grow even darker as you progress, as if they were
absorbing your power.  The hallway stretches on to the north.  To the south
there appears to be some remenants of light left.~
