#19503
Anti-Wizard's Chambers~
This is the bed chamber of the Anti-Wizard Felulius himself!  There are
the normal furnishings of a bedroom, a bed, chest-of-drawers, and closet.
There is also a pit here filled with the bones of dead mages, a key
ingredient to the making of dark matter.  The walls of this apartment are
no different than any of the other ones.  Dark, dull, magic sucking dark
matter.  There is a dark hallway to the south.~
