#19507
Karik's Trophy Room~
Decorating the dark black walls of this room are hundred's of magician's
heads.  The heads are of many different races, some of which disappeared
mysteriously thousands of years ago.  Some of the heads are freshly cut blood
still oozing from their necks.  There is a shiny white path underneath your
feet reflecting your light.  At a closer inspection you notice they are
skulls, no doubt from mage's of long ago.  To the west and south the dark
hallways continue.~
