Seflian's Throne Room~
In the northern corner of the room sits Seflian's monolithic throne.  An arch
of dark matter is strung along the top as a sort of decoration the rest is a
dark stone material that looks very hard, and very uncomfortable.  The room
other then the throne is completely vacant and made of dark black dark matter.
There is a hallway stretching southward and series of stone steps climbing up.~
