#19521
Central Registration Room~
Dark walls which seem to suck out light have come together to form a large
room.  In the ceiling here their is a rather large hole breaking at least some
of the terrifying feeling of claustrophobia though you cannot figure out what
use this hole might have.  There are a few chairs strewn around made of the
same dark matter that the walls are composed of.  Discarded bagage is heaped on
the ground in enourmous piles leaving the impression that once people take
whatever journey that is offered in this room, they seldom come back. The
hallway stretches on to the west.~
