#19522
Entrance to the Valley of Magical Destruction~
The smell of burning flesh fills your nose with such pungency it burns.
Crucified on either side of you are rows of small frail looking people with
the words, 'Stinking Mage' scratched into their foreheads.  Some of these
people are woman and even young children.  The rest of the terrain has been
completely devastated by the constant warfare and appears to be suffering from
extreme destrification.  Looking down at the narrow path on which you now stand
you can see exactly of what it is created, human fingers!  Thousands of fingers
rowed tightly together all facing north.  To the south there is a dark hole
made of dark matter slanting downwards forming into a sort of slide.~
