#19541
The Champion's Quarters~
You are dumbfounded by the sheer extravagance of this room.  The walls are not
covered with dark matter as all the other rooms but are instead plated with
gold.  Set in beautiful ornate plaques are weapons of all kinds, swords,
daggers, maces, bows, anything you can think of you see.  The floor is made of
golden tiles polished so brightly your reflection shines in them.  The bed
here is large and soft looking.  This must trully be the quarters of someone
great.~
