walking around freely as if they were people, even the path you now stand on
seems to be traveling its own course.  In tiny little patches there is rain,
in others hail, while in others snow, sun, high humidity, desert like
conditions all within five feet of each other.  The wilderness has been given
a voice, and this is what it speaks.  It would appear as if this twisting path
continues on to the north and east.~
196 0 SECT_FOREST
DDIR_NORTH
The Enchanted Wilderness.~
~
