#19656
The Poor Quarter~
You are standing between rows of buildings.  Dirt, papers, and other trash
blow through the blood stained streets.  Woman are working the corners and
press gangs are standing at the corners.  All the dejects have come here to
live out the rest of their miserable lives, magicians and warriors living in
complete disharmony.  Killing each other with complete abandonment because
even the guards are too afraid to visit here.  The filthy road leads to the
east while a beautiful, clean wilderness grows to the south.~
196 ROOM_DARK SECT_CITY
DDIR_SOUTH
The Enchanted Wilderness.~
~
